==English==

===Etymology===
{{w|Galvani}} {{suffix||ize}}. Galvani was the discoverer of the process.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɡælvænaɪz/}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[galvanise]] (''mostly UK'')

===Verb===
{{en-verb|galvaniz|ing}}

# {{transitive|chiefly|_|North America|chemistry}} To coat with a thin layer of [[metal]] by [[electrochemical]] means; to [[electroplate]].
# {{transitive|chiefly|_|North America}} To coat with rust-resistant [[zinc]]
# {{transitive|chiefly|_|North America}} To [[shock]] or [[stimulate]] into sudden activity

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to shock or stimulate}} [[startle]]

